    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「怖いですぅ、部長は歯に衣着せないから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「でも、部長が言ったとおりに直すとちゃんと面白くなるんですよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「さすが、小説家さんのおじいさまのお手伝いをしてるだけありますぅ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「将来は、立派な編集者さんになっちゃうかもしれませんね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
